rt 2, Grammar.","ar":"هذا الجزء الثاني، القواعد."},"id":"L003"},{"actor":"nabil","start":11.148,"text":{"en":"Listen, and notice the verbs.","ar":"استمع، ولاحظ الأفعال."},"id":"L004"},{"actor":"nabil","start":14.402,"text":{"en":"Listen to five lines from the workshop.","ar":"استمع إلى خمسة أسطر من الورشة."},"id":"L005"},{"actor":"nabil","start":17.848,"text":{"en":"Nabil services cars.","ar":"نبيل يصون السيارات."},"id":"L006"},{"actor":"nabil","start":20.742,"text":{"en":"He usually starts at eight.","ar":"هو يبدأ عادةً في الثامنة."},"id":"L007"},{"actor":"nabil","start":23.636,"text":{"en":"Right now, he is changing the oil.","ar":"الآن، إنّه يغيّر الزيت."},"id":"L008"},{"actor":"nabil","start":27.226,"text":{"en":"The workshop opens every day.","ar":"الورشة تفتح كلّ يوم."},"id":"L009"},{"actor":"nabil","start":30.264,"text":{"en":"Today, Tarek is learning from Nabil.","ar":"اليوم، طارق يتعلّم من نبيل."},"id":"L010"},{"actor":"nabil","start":33.902,"text":{"en":"Here are the five lines again.","ar":"هذه هي الأسطر الخمسة مرّة أخرى."},"id":"L011"},{"actor":"nabil","start":36.844,"text":{"en":"Which three lines are about every day?","ar":"أيّ ثلاثة أسطر عن كلّ يوم؟"},"subHold":8.115,"id":"L012"},{"actor":"nabil","start":44.959,"text":{"en":"Services, starts and opens. They happen every day.","ar":"يصون، يبدأ، تفتح. تحدث كلّ يوم."},"id":"L013"},{"actor":"nabil","start":50.493,"text":{"en":"Which two lines are about now?","ar":"أيّ سطرين عن الآن؟"},"subHold":7.381,"id":"L014"},{"actor":"nabil","start":57.874,"text":{"en":"Is changing and is learning. They are happening now.","ar":"يغيّر ويتعلّم. تحدث الآن."},"id":"L015"},{"actor":"nabil","start":62.712,"text":{"en":"A line under the verb means every day.","ar":"الخطّ تحت الفعل يعني كلّ يوم."},"id":"L016"},{"actor":"nabil","start":66.11,"text":{"en":"A box around the verb means now.","ar":"المربّع حول الفعل يعني الآن."},"id":"L017"},{"actor":"nabil","start":69.388,"text":{"en":"Every day, we say services. Now, we say is changing.","ar":"كلّ يوم نقول services. الآن نقول is changing."},"id":"L018"},{"actor":"nabil","start":75.378,"text":{"en":"Here is the rule.","ar":"هذه هي القاعدة."},"id":"L019"},{"actor":"nabil","start":77.72,"text":{"en":"Every day and usually: the present simple.","ar":"كلّ يوم وعادةً: المضارع البسيط."},"id":"L020"},{"actor":"nabil","start":81.358,"text":{"en":"Now, this week and at the moment: the present continuous.","ar":"الآن، هذا الأسبوع، في هذه اللحظة: المضارع المستمر."},"id":"L021"},{"actor":"nabil","start":85.812,"text":{"en":"Watch out! He changes the oil. Add s for he, she and it.","ar":"انتبه! He changes the oil. أضف s مع he، she، it."},"id":"L022"},{"actor":"nabil","start":92.834,"text":{"en":"And say: I am checking now.","ar":"وقل: I am checking now."},"id":"L023"},{"actor":"nabil","start":96.064,"text":{"en":"Well done. You practise this in the next video.","ar":"أحسنت. ستتدرّب على هذا في الفيديو التالي."},"id":"L024"}],"subtitles":{"enabled":true,"langs":"en,ar","show":null,"lang":{}},"badgePlacement":{"x":"0.016","y":"0.016","width":"0.205"},"audio":{"master":"audio.m4a","lines":[{"key":"fd3ffba74b0faea5","bytes":20304,"sha":"86b397c5e9c276d6","address":"lines/fd3ffba74b0faea5.mp3"},{"key":"fb07f6cc3fe00fdb","bytes":20448,"sha":"41dfb880d311bd37","address":"lines/fb07f6cc3fe00fdb.mp3"},{"key":"d9e3765be0623f05","bytes":17136,"sha":"50769d8b8b316093","address":"lines/d9e3765be0623f05.mp3"},{"key":"af997c90e29747c4","bytes":17424,"sha":"c20e6c90a095e39b","address":"lines/af997c90e29747c4.mp3"},{"key":"204fcb79173ec1d2","bytes":18576,"sha":"eefc0c54cb9685f6","address":"lines/204fcb79173ec1d2.mp3"},{"key":"a68693e952ef8a96","bytes":15264,"sha":"00816ea711557337","address":"lines/a68693e952ef8a96.mp3"},{"key":"67ea025fb64d4e8f","bytes":15264,"sha":"5c771afb9a516ecd","address":"lines/67ea025fb64d4e8f.mp3"},{"key":"18f00be608b03c13","bytes":19440,"sha":"612e120474b5174c","address":"lines/18f00be608b03c13.mp3"},{"key":"159d9cb393fde8bd","bytes":16128,"s